command-description-xuia-set_goal = Sets an NPC goal for the entity
command-description-xuia-add_allowed_goal = Adds an NPC goal to the list of goals the player can issue
command-description-xuia-remove_allowed_goal = Removes the NPC goal from the list of goals the player can issue
command-description-xuia-add_control = Adds the entity to the list of NPCs that the player can control
command-description-xuia-remove_control = Removes the entity from the list of NPCs that the player can control

command-description-uia-get_score = Returns a goal score between 0 and 1 for the GOAP agent
command-description-uia-set_goal = Sets the agent's current GOAP goal
